Attempting to save an unnamed buffer should prompt for the filename via
the minibuffer and then save to the given path.

-- config --
path: tests/data/config/without-fsys.toml
-- actions --
type: ihello, world!
# return to normal mode
type: <esc>
# attempt to save
type: :w\n
# should be presented with the minibuffer asking for a path
type: hello.txt\n
-- buffer-list --
0    * hello.txt
-- expected-windows --
0
-- expected-buffer-0 --
hello, world!

